  "description": "Dependency injection for ChromaDotNet.Client, the .NET client for Chroma and Chroma Cloud: AddChromaClient, AddKeyedChromaClient and CreateChromaClient. Tested with Chroma 0.4.10 to 1.5.9. Community project, not affiliated with Chroma.",
